{
  "cube_id": "Artificial-Sweetener/Base-Cubes/Anima/Prompt by Region.cube",
  "version": "2.2.0",
  "description": "\"Regional Prompting\" for Anima using tiled diffusion. Create regions with masks. Use [SEP] to create a region prompt; everything before your first [SEP] will be your global prompt. Mask and region prompt order matter; each region prompt after the first [SEP] will pair with whatever mask is next to it in line.\n\nLoRA scheduling is supported. LoRA in the global prompt will apply to the entire image, but LoRA in a regional prompt area will only apply to that region.",
